# Rust build artifacts
/target

# NOTE: Cargo.lock IS committed because this crate ships as a deployed
# binary (the `brutor-skill-runner` container in the SaaS ECS cluster
# and the trial bundle). The official Rust guidance: applications
# commit lockfiles, libraries don't — the security-boundary container
# image must build from the same dependency set every time.

# Environment — never commit real secrets. The BRUTOR_SKILL_RUNNER_JWT_SECRET
# in particular is shared with gateway-core and lives in AWS Secrets
# Manager / the trial bundle's .env, not here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local Cargo overrides (dev-only path patches)
.cargo/config.toml

# Coverage / profiling output
*.profraw
*.profdata
tarpaulin-report.html
cobertura.xml
